(NOTICE INVITING TENDER \(NIT\) - CLOUD HEALTHCARE INFORMATION SYSTEM) '
(Tender Reference Number: HMIS-HEALTH-2026-042) '
(Issuing Authority: State Directorate of Medical Health & Family Welfare) '
(Project: Enterprise Cloud Hospital Management & Telemedicine System) '
(Estimated Contract Value: INR 4,20,00,000 \(INR 4.20 Crore\)) '
(Submission Deadline: 21 Days from Publication) '
(SECTION 1: PROJECT SCOPE & OBJECTIVES) '
(1.1 Proposals are invited for design, cloud hosting, rollout, and support of a unified,) '
(HIPAA and DISHA compliant Cloud Hospital Information Management System \(HMIS\) across 15 hospitals.) '
(1.2 The system will handle outpatient registration, IPD EHR records, laboratory analytics, and billing.) '
ET
endstream
