(SECTION 2: ELIGIBILITY & FINANCIAL QUALIFICATIONS) '
(2.1 Industry Experience: Minimum 4 years of operational experience in deploying healthcare IT platforms.) '
(2.2 Turnover Requirement: Average annual turnover of not less than INR 3.50 Crore during the last 3 years.) '
(2.3 Past Deployments: Bidder must have successfully deployed at least 2 hospital systems of 300+ beds.) '
(2.4 EMD: Bank Guarantee of INR 8,40,000 \(2% of estimated value\).) '
ET
