(SECTION 3: TECHNICAL & DATA SECURITY STANDARDS) '
(3.1 Certifications: Valid ISO 27001:2013 and ISO 20000-1 certifications are mandatory.) '
(3.2 Compliance: Adherence to National Digital Health Mission \(ABDM\) standards and HL7 FHIR protocols.) '
(3.3 Cloud Hosting: Data residency must strictly remain within local certified Tier-III data centers.) '
(3.4 Backup & Disaster Recovery: Maximum RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 1 hour.) '
